            <title>[ZEPPELIN-869] Search notebook to handle empty result.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-869</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Creating this from &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/911#issuecomment-221156084&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/911#issuecomment-221156084&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;When the result is nothing, Zeppelin needs to show some statement like &quot;We couldn&#8217;t find any notebook matching &apos;something_you_typed&apos; &quot;`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And search box should get cleared when clicked on any other link.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
